  "releaseNotes": "Experimental OCS 68EC020/68020 prerelease. Correct extended memory-source MOVE.L decoding and add tested operand forms reached after the Lotus III disk-two prompt. Retain the Chip RAM instruction-cache correction from .51 and optional EC020 code-reader fixes from .50. Preserve 68000 execution and existing 030/040 cache policies. Instruction timing remains a bounded execution policy, not hardware certification. Full game compatibility and physical accelerator timing are not certified.",
